      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree, the movement is extremely slow and unprecise because of that.\nAnother issue is how far you have to grab the mirror at least when it's on a 45 degree angle next to you. I don't know how to grab hitbox is supposed to work but I have to essentially fully pull my arm back so that my hand is near my elbow just to grab the mirror when it's close to me. It should be a lot easier to grab the mirror when it's close to you.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
