      "value": "@{620f7ecc5abcc7434a486858|full_name}: I have the opposite issue on Quest actually, where I have to fully extend to grab it, lmao. Yeah, it feels alot like they were copying those portable mirror mods behaviors, rather than making it feel native to VRChat.\n \nIt should honestly be like the selfie cam, but large, adjustable, and performant.\n \nThe ability to change the aliasing and resolution would be nice too, since it's a bit high quality.",
