  "details": "1. The movement of the portable mirror when set to grabbable is heavily smoothed, and does not feel responsive to VR users, resulting in a feeling that the mirror is not responding or moving at all.\n2. The movement controls of the Selfie-Camera meanwhile are intuitive comparitively.\n \nSuggestion: make portable mirror grabbable and moveable in a similar manner to the portable camera. Additionally, add a \"Auto Level\" option which maintains appropriate orientation to the player, and rename the grabbable option to \"Handheld\" to convey this change more appropriately.",
